{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f9e31063-98d5-8bb1-be61-691ac7e34802",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:57:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:53:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Pardon me, is this the office that handles permits?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:53:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Um, I own a house on Gibbs Avenue, number 286, over on the Ocean Drive side. And I'm having a fence put in. Pardon me, can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So it's vinyl, five feet tall, and a man is supposed to start next week. So I wanted to ask, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence needs a permit here. You want that in hand before anybody digs a post hole. Is the fence going around the whole yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Along the side and the back, I think. Oh, and it's a corner lot. I don't know if that matters. Somebody mentioned sight lines, and I didn't understand what they meant, pardon me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does matter on a corner. Sight lines are about drivers being able to see around the corner. If a fence sits too close to the intersection, it can block the view. So the height and where it sits near the corner get looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So five feet might be a problem? Pardon me, I thought the height was the main thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be, depending on where it goes. Height is one piece, location is the other. On the side facing the street, near the corner, they'll want to see exactly where it's going. That's what the permit review is for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Then, um, do I need a survey? I have some papers from when I bought it, but I don't know if that's the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those might be the same thing, or might not. Do you have a plot plan, a drawing with the lot lines on it? Usually that's what you'd get from a survey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think there's a drawing with a little square for the house. Is that a plot plan? I'm sorry, I don't really know the words."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be it. If it shows the lot lines and where the house sits, bring it in or send a copy. If it's old or hard to read, the inspector may ask for a newer survey. I can't tell you without seeing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, all right. So I bring the drawing, and then they tell me if I need a survey? Pardon me, I want to be sure I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Bring the drawing, and a sketch of where the fence goes, with the height and the material. Vinyl, five feet. The office will take it from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Is it at City Hall that I come? I was there once as a little girl, with my father. I remember the big staircase. I don't know if it's the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the building's still here. Come to the zoning and inspections counter, and they'll point you to the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the man starting next week, should I tell him to wait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, tell him to hold off until you have the permit. If he puts it up first, you could have to take it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:57:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh dear. All right, I'll call him today. So drawing, sketch, and the permit before he starts. And maybe a survey, depending."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Mr. Lombardi. Pardon me, was it Lombardi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Greg is fine. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Greg. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
